msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san? It's me, Shibayama, the guy who asked you to\r\n"
"help collect that loan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Oh, hey. What's going on?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "It looks like Motoyama has left Pink Street."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Sorry for the extra trouble, but do you think you could\r\n"
"find out where he is now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "...All right. Sorry I didn't get to him in time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Nah, I'm the one who should be apologizing for all this\r\n"
"trouble. Well, good luck!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Guess I'll just have to have another look around Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"Well, I managed to catch Motoyama, but he'd already spent\r\n"
"the 1,000,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Looks like we won't be able to collect that loan today\r\n"
"after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Sorry about all that running around I made you do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Guess this means I won't be needing your help anymore..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "All right. Sorry I couldn't help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"You helped plenty! You taught me a lot, and I'm really\r\n"
"grateful for that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Well, bye, now. Thanks again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

